course: dictionary
lesson: 4425
title: Place names in context
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A place name such as Hampshire starts with a capital letter because it names one special place. Hampshire is a county on the south coast of England, with cities such as Southampton, Portsmouth and Winchester.
explain: The same name can belong to more than one place, so read the words around it to find the right one. «In New Hampshire in 2024 a robocall used an AI copy of President Biden's voice.» The word New and the American president tell you this is the state in the USA.
explain: Sometimes the name only tells you where a story happens. «In Hampshire, Poppy gives the whole class designer pencils for Christmas.» The sentence does not describe Hampshire itself, but it tells you the setting of the story.
fact: Hampshire is a county on the south coast of England.
fact: Its cities include Southampton, Portsmouth and Winchester.
fact: New Hampshire is a state in the north-east of the USA, named after the English county.
fact: A place name starts with a capital letter, such as «Hampshire».
fact: When two places share a name, the words around it show you which one is meant.
exercise: «In Hampshire, Poppy gives the whole class designer pencils for Christmas.» What is Hampshire in this sentence? | A type of Christmas present | A person in the class | A kind of designer pencil | *A place where the story happens
exercise: «In New Hampshire in 2024 a robocall used an AI copy of President Biden's voice.» Which place is the sentence about? | Winchester, a city in England | Portsmouth, a city in England | Hampshire, a county in England | *New Hampshire, a state in the USA
exercise: Which of these is a city in the county of Hampshire? | Glasgow | Belfast | Cardiff | *Portsmouth
test: Which of these words is a place name that starts with a capital letter because it names one special place? | Christmas | pencils | *Hampshire | Poppy
test: The American state of New Hampshire was named after which place? | *The English county of Hampshire | Scotland | Wales | Ireland
exam: Hampshire is a county on the south coast of which country? | Scotland | Ireland | Wales | *England
